{"seq":1,"slug":"quantiles-sketches","title":"分位数概要","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/practice/quantiles-sketches","wordCount":1933,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"分位数概要\">分位数概要</h1><p>「我们服务的 P99 延迟是多少」——这是 SRE 每天盯着的数字，也是前三章的结构都答不上来的问题。<a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/hyperloglog\">HyperLogLog</a> 数种类、<a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/count-min-sketch\">Count-Min Sketch</a> 数次数，但「第 99 百分位的值是多少」问的是整个<strong>分布</strong>的形状。精确求分位数要把所有观测值排序，对一条无界的延迟流根本不可能。分位数概要（quantile sketch）用很小的固定空间，近似回答任意分位点的查询，是这一章补齐的最后一类核心问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分位数问题与近似的两种误差\">核心概念：分位数问题与近似的两种误差</h2><p>先说清要回答什么。给定一组数值（延迟、金额、文件大小），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 分位数（quantile）就是「有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 比例的数据小于等于它」的那个值——中位数是 0.5 分位数，P99 是 0.99 分位数。相关的还有反向查询「秩（rank）」：给一个值，问有多大比例的数据比它小。分位数概要要同时支持这两类查询，还要能输出近似的 CDF（累积分布）和直方图。</p>\n<p>近似分位数有两种截然不同的误差定义，选错会南辕北辙：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>秩误差（rank error）</strong>：保证返回值的真实秩与目标秩相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>。比如查 P99、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon=0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>，返回值的真实分位可能落在 P98 到 P100 之间。KLL、GK 走这条路。</li>\n<li><strong>相对值误差（relative value error）</strong>：保证返回值与真值的<strong>比值</strong>误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>。这对长尾分布的尾部分位（P999、P9999）尤其重要——尾部数值跨好几个数量级，秩误差在这里几乎无意义。DDSketch 走这条路。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  D[数值流: 延迟/金额] --&gt; SK[分位数概要]&#10;  SK --&gt; Q1[查 P50 中位数]&#10;  SK --&gt; Q2[查 P99 尾延迟]&#10;  SK --&gt; Q3[查某值的秩]&#10;  SK --&gt; CDF[输出近似 CDF/直方图]&#10;  SK --&gt; E{误差类型}&#10;  E --&gt;|秩误差| RANK[KLL / GK]&#10;  E --&gt;|相对值误差| REL[DDSketch]\">flowchart TD\n  D[数值流: 延迟/金额] --&gt; SK[分位数概要]\n  SK --&gt; Q1[查 P50 中位数]\n  SK --&gt; Q2[查 P99 尾延迟]\n  SK --&gt; Q3[查某值的秩]\n  SK --&gt; CDF[输出近似 CDF/直方图]\n  SK --&gt; E{误差类型}\n  E --&gt;|秩误差| RANK[KLL / GK]\n  E --&gt;|相对值误差| REL[DDSketch]</pre><h2 id=\"三种主流算法\">三种主流算法</h2><p>工业界常用的分位数概要有几个，设计理念各异。</p>\n<p>**GK（Greenwald-Khanna，2001）**是最早被广泛采用的确定性算法，维护一组带秩误差边界的元组，空间约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ε</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon}\\log(\\varepsilon N))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">εN</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 秩误差保证。它经典但合并较麻烦，在分布式场景不如后来者顺手。</p>\n<p>**t-digest（Ted Dunning）**是过去十年最流行的实践方案，思路是把数据聚成一簇簇「质心（centroid）」，靠近分布两端（P1、P99 这些尾部）的簇做得更细，中间的簇更粗——于是它对尾部分位天然更准，这正符合监控对尾延迟的关注。它空间固定、易合并、实现广泛（Elasticsearch、Spark、众多 APM 都在用）。但要警惕一个 2025 年研究反复强调的硬伤：<strong>t-digest 的最坏情况误差是无界的</strong>，存在能让它显著失准的对抗性输入，它不提供形式化的精度保证。</p>\n<p>**KLL（Karnin-Lang-Liberty，2016）**是带形式化保证的现代算法，用分层的压缩缓冲区实现近最优的「空间换秩误差」，给出严格的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 秩误差边界且完全可合并。它是 <a href=\"systems-applications\">Apache DataSketches</a> 的主推分位数概要，正逐渐成为需要可靠保证场景的工业标准。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>误差类型</th>\n<th>形式化保证</th>\n<th>空间</th>\n<th>合并</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GK</td>\n<td>秩误差</td>\n<td>有（确定性）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ε</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon}\\log(\\varepsilon N))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">εN</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>较难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t-digest</td>\n<td>秩误差（尾部偏准）</td>\n<td>无（最坏无界）</td>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td>易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KLL</td>\n<td>秩误差</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>近最优，固定预算</td>\n<td>易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDSketch</td>\n<td>相对值误差</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>随值域对数增长</td>\n<td>易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ddsketch-与相对误差\">DDSketch 与相对误差</h2><p>Datadog 在 2019 年提出的 <strong>DDSketch</strong> 值得单独讲，因为它解决了 t-digest 和 KLL 都不直接保证的问题：<strong>相对值误差</strong>。</p>\n<p>它的核心很简单：用指数分桶。把值域按几何级数切成桶——第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个桶覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\gamma^i, \\gamma^{i+1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma = \\frac{1+\\varepsilon}{1-\\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。落入同一桶的值，其相对误差天然不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>。查分位数时只需累加桶计数找到目标桶。</p>\n<p>这个设计对监控延迟极其友好：延迟从 1 毫秒到 10 秒跨四个数量级，指数分桶让每个量级都有相同的相对精度，P50 和 P9999 都准。代价是桶数随值域跨度对数增长（而非固定），但实践中延迟值域有限，桶数完全可控。它还完全可合并——逐桶相加即可，是分布式延迟统计的优秀选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地与选型\">工程落地与选型</h2><p>分位数概要在真实系统里的位置很明确：所有「监控、SLO、计费分布、A/B 实验指标」类场景。Prometheus 的 histogram、各类 APM 的延迟面板、数据库的延迟统计，背后都是某种分位数概要。</p>\n<p>选型可以归纳成几条经验。需要严格的可靠性保证（金融、SLA 计算）、且关心秩分位——选 <strong>KLL</strong>，它有形式化保证又可合并。需要尾部延迟的相对精度（典型的 P99/P999 监控）——选 <strong>DDSketch</strong>，相对误差保证最贴合长尾。已经在用 t-digest 且数据非对抗、对极端精度不苛求——继续用也没问题，它实践表现通常很好，只是别在可能遭遇对抗输入或需要硬保证的地方依赖它。</p>\n<p>2025 年这个方向仍在演进，出现了像 SplineSketch 这样试图「既要 t-digest 的实践精度、又要形式化保证」的新算法，说明分位数近似远未盖棺定论。选型时优先看你所用平台（DataSketches、Datadog、Elasticsearch）原生支持哪种，跨系统合并时务必确认双方用的是<strong>同一种概要、同一套参数</strong>——不同概要无法互相合并，这是<a href=\"pitfalls-tuning\">陷阱与调参</a>里的合并语义坑在分位数上的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能拿直方图凑合\">为什么不能拿直方图凑合</h2><p>很多团队第一反应是「我用固定区间的直方图（histogram）不就能算分位数了吗」，这在某些场景行得通，但有两个硬伤值得点明。第一，固定区间需要<strong>预先知道值域</strong>：你得提前定好桶的边界（如 0–10ms、10–20ms……），可延迟的真实范围往往事前未知，定窄了尾部全挤进最后一个桶、定宽了精度全无。第二，固定区间的精度在值域内是<strong>均匀</strong>的，而真实需求恰恰相反——P99、P999 这些尾部分位最重要，却因为尾部数据稀疏而落进同一个粗桶里，估不准。</p>\n<p>分位数概要正是为绕开这两点而生：t-digest 用自适应质心让尾部更细，KLL 用分层缓冲在固定预算下给出秩误差保证，DDSketch 用指数分桶让每个数量级有相同的相对精度、且无需预知值域。这就是为什么生产监控宁可用这些概要而非朴素直方图——它们把精度花在了真正要紧的尾部，又能跨节点<a href=\"systems-applications\">无损合并</a>。当然，若值域已知且只关心中段分位，固定直方图（如 Prometheus 经典 histogram）依然简单够用，选型仍回到误差类型与值域是否已知这两个问题上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分位数概要回答「P99 是多少」这类分布问题，是前三章结构都答不了的一类，支持分位、秩、CDF、直方图查询。</li>\n<li>近似有两种误差：秩误差（KLL、GK、t-digest）和相对值误差（DDSketch），长尾尾部分位用相对误差才有意义。</li>\n<li>t-digest 最流行、尾部偏准、易合并，但最坏情况误差无界、无形式化保证；KLL 有严格秩误差保证且可合并，是 DataSketches 主推。</li>\n<li>DDSketch 用指数分桶保证相对误差，对跨数量级的延迟监控特别合适，逐桶相加即可合并。</li>\n<li>选型看保证需求与误差类型，跨系统合并必须同概要同参数；2025 年仍有 SplineSketch 等新算法涌现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分位数概要","id":"分位数概要"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分位数问题与近似的两种误差","id":"核心概念-分位数问题与近似的两种误差"},{"level":2,"text":"三种主流算法","id":"三种主流算法"},{"level":2,"text":"DDSketch 与相对误差","id":"ddsketch-与相对误差"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地与选型","id":"工程落地与选型"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能拿直方图凑合","id":"为什么不能拿直方图凑合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Top-K 与重元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/cardinality-frequency/top-k-heavy-hitters"},"next":{"title":"系统应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/practice/systems-applications"}}